public sealed class BoatGraphic:MaskableGraphic {
 protected override void OnPopulateMesh(VertexHelper v){v.Clear();for(int i=0;i<24;i++){float t=i/24f,u=(i+1)/24f;Stroke(v,new Vector2(t*145,18-Mathf.Sin(t*Mathf.PI)*14),new Vector2(u*145,18-Mathf.Sin(u*Mathf.PI)*14),1.6f); }Stroke(v,new Vector2(0,19),new Vector2(145,19),1);for(int i=0;i<16;i++){float t=i/16f,u=(i+1)/16f;Stroke(v,new Vector2(48+t*50,21+Mathf.Sin(t*Mathf.PI)*22),new Vector2(48+u*50,21+Mathf.Sin(u*Mathf.PI)*22),1.3f);}Stroke(v,new Vector2(117,13),new Vector2(128,65),1);}
 void Stroke(VertexHelper v,Vector2 a,Vector2 b,float w){var n=new Vector2(-(b-a).y,(b-a).x).normalized*w*.5f;Add(v,a-n,a+n,b+n,color);Add(v,a-n,b+n,b-n,color);}

 void Add(VertexHelper v,Vector2 a,Vector2 b,Vector2 c,Color32 col){int n=v.currentVertCount;v.AddVert(a,col,Vector2.zero);v.AddVert(b,col,Vector2.zero);v.AddVert(c,col,Vector2.zero);v.AddTriangle(n,n+1,n+2);}
}
